# Ripgrep (and fd, ag) skip these paths by default, so a recursive search of the repository does not
# put held-out or reserve case text in an agent's context. Entries are anchored to this folder, one
# path component each; an explicit path argument still searches them. Layout and rule:
# eval/qa/README.md, "Held-out split". test/case-search-ignore.test.mjs pins this list.
/corpus/
/holdout-cases.json
/protocol-history-blind-cases.json
/protocol-history-blind-cases-v2.json
